#!/usr/bin/dyalogscript

⎕IO←1
⎕SE.(⍎⊃2⎕FIX'/StartupSession.aplf',⍨2⎕NQ#'GetEnvironment' 'DYALOG')

⍝ Load Jarvis from Tatin (fetched on first run, as listed in packages/apl-dependencies.txt)
{}⎕SE.UCMD 'Tatin.Version' ⍝ make sure Tatin is loaded into ⎕SE
{}⎕SE.Tatin.ReInstallDependencies⍣(~1∊⊃1 ⎕NINFO⍠1⊢'../../packages/*')⊢'../../packages'
{}⎕SE.Tatin.LoadDependencies '../../packages' #

⎕SE.Link.Import '#' '../../APLSource'
⎕SE.Link.Import '#' 'APLSource'

Init
router.ThreadMode←0
Start
